{"about_the_game":"Fulfill contracts that offer clear objectives with a fixed monetary reward and options to complete bonus challenges for payouts. With hundreds of ways to take down a wide range of targets, Contracts offers precise, strategic sniping gameplay at its absolute best.<br><br>Play as a paid assassin; a hit man for hire, and beware of rival snipers who won\u2019t hesitate to disrupt your best-laid plans.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-ended contracts</h2> Bounties and challenges deliver strong replayability options to eliminate targets and collect cash to redeem for upgrades.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/1a3438242c367ad4a73cf4772ce16bac.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > An all-new Dynamic Reticle System</h2> Offers the most realistic and intense sniping experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/01324d6c2d4f419c9198670ff6de8412.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Upgradeable AR Mask</h2> With the ability to scan the environment and highlight weakness or objects of interest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/f1f31b21131c4a17a99bd3b90ae42052.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An arsenal of new gadgets</h2> Including drones, remote sniper turrets and gas grenades. Show off your stealth skills, execute silent takedowns and be rewarded for a strategic play style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/e67691cd96e09e847f588626354f7bb2.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Battle the brutal wilderness of Siberia</h2> Fight to survive the intensity of snow-covered mountains, lush forests and secret bases hidden deep in the mountainside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/84bf2f25c197cc91b804a7cbfe0f452e.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cf1bd6db0e2dc55ced365e22926034e1b2126ab9.jpg","localized_name":"Snowstorm","name":"Snowstorm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/cf1bd6db0e2dc55ced365e22926034e1b2126ab9.jpg"},{"icon":"f5a64167582a2d5bec42b8a6be17e2afc38ab10f.jpg","localized_name":"Black Gold","name":"Black Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/f5a64167582a2d5bec42b8a6be17e2afc38ab10f.jpg"},{"icon":"a0c8be21e867cacf87dd6b08a429471d21f952ab.jpg","localized_name":"Cosa Nostra","name":"Cosa Nostra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/a0c8be21e867cacf87dd6b08a429471d21f952ab.jpg"},{"icon":"4b44b808a8d965f91abc63f6c0ca5d81b67f3c90.jpg","localized_name":"Exitus Acta Probat","name":"Exitus Acta Probat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/4b44b808a8d965f91abc63f6c0ca5d81b67f3c90.jpg"},{"icon":"7577e524f5b8975dcc376068469b320d10abb4fd.jpg","localized_name":"Final Countdown","name":"Final Countdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/7577e524f5b8975dcc376068469b320d10abb4fd.jpg"},{"icon":"f3049e6b8b3d313f886a8a0456b0747f9b6aea44.jpg","localized_name":"Frost Wolf","name":"Frost Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/973580/f3049e6b8b3d313f886a8a0456b0747f9b6aea44.jpg"},{"icon":"310d22a4b39fe2cb43df277199ff05baeaa1d56a.jpg","localized_name":"Debt Collector","name":"Debt Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati