ight weakness or objects of interest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/f1f31b21131c4a17a99bd3b90ae42052.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An arsenal of new gadgets</h2> Including drones, remote sniper turrets and gas grenades. Show off your stealth skills, execute silent takedowns and be rewarded for a strategic play style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/e67691cd96e09e847f588626354f7bb2.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Battle the brutal wilderness of Siberia</h2> Fight to survive the intensity of snow-covered mountains, lush forests and secret bases hidden deep in the mountainside.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/extras/84bf2f25c197cc91b804a7cbfe0f452e.avif?t=1741954017\" width=600 height=184 /></span>","developers":["CI Games"],"dlc":[1174630,1174631,1174632,1228720,1244510,1502350,1674634,1674635,1674636,1674637],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973580/header.jpg?t=1741954017","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Sniper Ghost Warrior Contracts \u00a9 2019 CI Games SE, all rights reserved. Published by CI Games SE. Developed by CI Games SE. Sniper Ghost Warrior is a trademark of CI Games SE, Portions of this software are included under license \u00a9 2004-2019 Crytek GmbH. All rights reserved. \u00a9 2016 Valve Corporation. Steamworks and the Steamworks logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation in the U.S. and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: